-- title:
--   An element congruent to one inside a coprime ideal
-- statement:
--   Let $K$ be a number field and $\mathfrak m=(\mathfrak m_0,\mathfrak m_\infty)$ a modulus, with nonzero integral ideal $\mathfrak m_0$ and a finite set $\mathfrak m_\infty$ of real places. Let $D\subseteq\mathcal O_K$ be a nonzero integral ideal with $D+\mathfrak m_0=\mathcal O_K$. There exists $a\in\mathcal O_K$ such that
--
--   $$
--   a\ne0,\qquad a\in D,\qquad a\equiv1\pmod{\mathfrak m_0},\qquad w(a)>0\quad(w\in\mathfrak m_\infty).
--   $$
--
--   This realizes the finite congruence and real-place conditions of a ray modulus within a prescribed coprime ideal.
